  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Red Dragon Disciple initiation reward (roadmap: red-dragon-disciple-quest), given by q_rdd_finish with 1000 XP when the Ember of the Old Wyrm is handed to Halmir. Mirrors the sibling prestige rewards' power tier (three +3-tier properties, no AB/damage -- forge-cap-safe): Spellcraft +3 (skill subtype 16), Intimidate +3 (skill subtype 24), Saving Throw Bonus vs Fire +3 (IP_CONST_SAVEVS_FIRE = 9, verified in ovr/nwscript.nss)."
  },
