  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A drop-shaped stone of deep red on a plain iron chain, warm to the touch in any weather, with a slow pulse in it if you hold it still -- like a second heart, or a banked coal. Halmir the Grey gave it over when the Ember of the Old Wyrm was laid in his hand: the token of those the orders call Red Dragon Disciples, whose blood has felt the flame and answered it. The fire that ruined Dale does not frighten what is already kin to it."
    }
  },
